      "alt_text": "Generic framework architecture. A StructuredProgram passes through explicit lowering to a literal Program. The literal Program, TaskSpec with access and budgets, and an answer or complete artifact feed ProgrammerSession. Candidate history proceeds to caller checks and selection, sealing a candidate or abstaining, a caller-owned held-out evaluator, and EvaluationReceipt. Callers must run checks and retain structured proposals and lowering receipts.",
      "caller_and_scope_notes": [
        "Caller responsibility: run required checks and retain structured proposals and lowering receipts.",
        "Submitting a literal program does not automatically retain those files or certify a candidate."
